{"version":1,"content":"<p>【再進化 😆】在當前全球頂級 GPU 算力供不應求且成本高昂的背景下，中國近期湧現大量「Mac mini 農場」。</p><p>早前的影片中，我們看到這些農場只是拿個普通貨架來安放。</p><p>但現在已經發展出「專用 Mac mini 農場機架」，可以更高密度地部署這些 Mac mini，要組建千台規模的 AI 運算叢集變得相當輕鬆。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:35.323397+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T05:08:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:57:38.183277+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416834+00:00","content_hash":"a5d77006858efc9a10e70bfde9218cbcb45f8443366e0f945723414c8ffc6ddf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}